# RIF Dataset Foundry

A governed, configuration-driven dataset engineering platform for building reproducible, versioned datasets from heterogeneous sources.

## Vision

Transform raw datasets into evidence-backed, license-aware, semantically chunked datasets for SFT, DPO, RAG, evaluation, and future AI workflows.

See `CLAUDE.md` for repository engineering guidance.
